Let word be "sadbutsad".
Let needle be "sad".
Let word length be the number of characters in word.
Let needle length be the number of characters in needle.
Let final be word length minus needle length.
Let answer be -1.
For every position from 0 to final.
Let finish be position plus needle length.
Let piece be the slice of word from position to finish.
If piece is needle, set answer to position, print answer, then stop.

If answer is -1, print -1.
